            <ArticleTitle>Chronic pain in paraplegics.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>933-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors classify the three types of chronic pain in paraplegics: lesional area pain, projected pain, and triggered pain. The clinical description and proposed treatment for each type of pain are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
